 "remarks": "Welcome to this inviting 1BR unit located in the heart of New Canaan, across from beautiful Mead Park where tennis, pickleball, and a lake for contemplation is just steps away. Enjoy the convenience of walking to the train, shops, restaurants, and library, offering an easy and very connected lifestyle. Located on the main level, this condo features hardwood flooring, a reserved parking space, and a rear walk-out providing convenient access to parking. Its location and low-maintenance lifestyle make it a terrific opportunity for a first-time buyer, downsizer, or anyone seeking an alternative to renting. New Canaan is a wonderful community known for its natural beauty, vibrant town center, excellent restaurants and shops, and abundance of community activities. With transportation, recreation and everyday amenities within easy reach, this condominium is a wonderful place to begin your homeownership journey and an even better place to call home. (More pics coming)",
